   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_01.mp3",
     "text": "Can we please talk about something happy now?"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_02.mp3",
     "text": "I have Psy."
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_03.mp3",
     "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_04.mp3",
     "screen": [
      "street",
      "rodeo"
     ],
     "text": "Our next story comes from a neighborhood you already know. Even if you think you don't."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_05.mp3",
     "screen": "station",
     "big": true,
     "text": "Gangnam. Yes. That Gangnam."
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_06.mp3",
     "text": "Wait. Is this about the horse dance? Please tell me this is about the horse dance."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_07.mp3",
     "screen": [
      "route",
      "band",
      "parade"
     ],
     "big": true,
     "text": "It is about a festival. This weekend is the fifteenth Gangnam Festival: a one-kilometer street parade, giant character balloons, and a traditional Korean marching band leading the way."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_08.mp3",
     "screen": "psy",
     "text": "And on Sunday, a K-pop concert closed out by the man who taught the entire planet to say 'Gangnam'. Psy."
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_09.mp3",
     "text": "Psy. In Gangnam. That is the biggest home game in music history!"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_10.mp3",
     "screen": "tickets",
     "big": true,
     "text": "Thirteen thousand free concert tickets. Gone almost immediately."
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_11.mp3",
     "text": "Free?! I would have fought someone for those."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_12.mp3",
     "screen": "frenzy",
     "big": true,
     "text": "This is a serious news program. We do not fight for tickets. We refresh the page calmly, like adults."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_13.mp3",
     "screen": [
      "nebuta1",
      "nebuta2",
      "dosan"
     ],
     "text": "Organizers even studied New York's Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade and Japan's Nebuta Festival. The goal: when people think 'K-festival', they think Gangnam."
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_14.mp3",
     "text": "Admit it. You're going."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_15.mp3",
     "text": "I have... prior commitments."
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "audio": "audio/ep01_gangnam_16.mp3",
     "text": "K's Take: Fourteen years after one song put Gangnam on the world map, Gangnam is still trying to live up to it. Honestly? Respect."
    }
   ],
   "short": {
    "from": 4,
    "to": 11
   }
